# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/dns

## Purpose
DNS resolution, DoH, DNS tunneling/support, preflight checks, and stateless smart fallback resolution.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `networking` (rank 2; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (75): `blocklist_packs.go`, `blocklist_packs_test.go`, `bounded_cache.go`, `bounded_cache_test.go`, `centralized_resolvers.go`, `cf_api_client.go`, `custom_zones.conf`, `ddns_bounds.go`, `ddns_bounds_test.go`, `ddns_retry_test.go`, `ddns_updater.go`, `dns_fallback.go` …
- Child folders: `blocklist_packs/`, `testdata/`.

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `dns`.
- Notable exported surface: `ARQ`, `ARQConfig`, `ARQStreamState`, `Anchor`, `Anomaly`, `AppendPackedControlBlock`, `AttemptMetric`, `AutoTunePreset`, `AutoTunePresetStability`, `AutoTunePresets` …
- Daemon-local dependencies: `internal/foundation/remoteaction`, `internal/networking/geoip`, `internal/protocols/reliable`.
- Direct daemon callers: `cmd`, `internal/adapters/api`, `internal/integrations/sub`.

## Invariants
- `networking` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
- Update this context when ownership, supported interfaces, or child-folder meaning changes; do not use it as a changelog.
